# Tailscale with the WebSocket fallbacks, for machines behind a proxy that intercepts TLS and refuses Tailscale's own
# upgrades but passes WebSockets (some AI agents' sandboxes). Applied by build-tailscaled.sh after the relay patch.
# - Control: tailscale/tailscale#22643 (NightFeather0615): hook in control/controlhttp and
#   the opt-in feature/controlwebsocket package. Plus one local line: TS_CONTROL_WEBSOCKET=1 goes straight to
#   WebSocket, skipping the request that's certain to be refused.
# - Relay: Tailscale's own feature/derpwebsocket, linked in, plus TS_DERP_WEBSOCKET=1 (WebSocket first).
